      "index": "ax",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 374724553,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1950918089,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793374192085,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " plxd B\n - Host key P-256: hostId = JWK thumbprint\n - Control WebSocket to the relay, opened\n   with a signed, single-use time proof\n - Listener :7341, TLS, private ranges only\n - POST /api/auth/account, only while\n   relay is on:\n     every clerk-verify check (RS256, iss,\n     aud, client_id, sid, azp, exp, nbf)\n     sub == this host's account\n     iat within 60 s, own clock, 5 min skew\n - Approved keys only: DPoP admin session,\n   proof on the /ws upgrade (0007)\n - Terminals: shell, installs, CLI sign-ins\n - Reports LAN and Tailscale addresses as routes",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "plxdB",
      "originalText": " plxd B\n - Host key P-256: hostId = JWK thumbprint\n - Control WebSocket to the relay, opened\n   with a signed, single-use time proof\n - Listener :7341, TLS, private ranges only\n - POST /api/auth/account, only while\n   relay is on:\n     every clerk-verify check (RS256, iss,\n     aud, client_id, sid, azp, exp, nbf)\n     sub == this host's account\n     iat within 60 s, own clock, 5 min skew\n - Approved keys only: DPoP admin session,\n   proof on the /ws upgrade (0007)\n - Terminals: shell, installs, CLI sign-ins\n - Reports LAN and Tailscale addresses as routes",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
